 for the pair  just yet when the science fair rolls  around once again they get right back  into their rivalry and when josh thinks  mindy professes her love to distract him  from making his proton laser  things get messy they break up once  again and the episodes leading up to the  series finale are full of fights  angsty makeout sessions and more  competition however fans got their end  game when the two sit next to each other  at helen's wedding when josh  asks if they should get back together  mindy replies okay  but i get to be the girlfriend and the  rest is history  well ha  unlike his brother josh who preferred  long-term relationships drake parker had  many many many girlfriends  right from the very first episode the  first one viewers got to know was  tiffany  although she was dating the school's  football player buck she agreed to go  out with drake however buck crashes  their date and ends up mistaking  josh for drake josh is challenged to a  fight  and to prepare the brothers hilarious  sign up for karate lessons  in hopes they'll learn how to defend  themselves josh ends up getting punched  in the face  making him really angry at drake for  getting him into the situation  in the end the viewers learn that no  girlfriend is worth ruining their  brotherly bond over  tiffany wasn't the only relationship  drake had that josh got in hot water  susan who was also introduced early on  in the season was dating drake  but has some major ulterior motives  susan was actually super obsessed with  josh and was his first ever kiss when  she confronts  josh about her feelings and kisses him  drake catches them and throws a wedge  between the brothers  although josh tries to prove his  innocence drake sides with his  girlfriend suen  it is until jake remembers that he  actually has the entire encounter  recorded  that's that's not what it looks like  yeah neither are you  and josh's name is cleared the  stepbrothers stayed in good standing and  susan was sent packing 