oka  josh arranges a friendship ceremony for  the three of them that accidentally ties  the knot between drake and yuka  while drake is definitely into her he  just wasn't ready for marriage  the two brothers come up with a plan  that had her father tearing up the  marriage certificate before you could  even say  pen pal they fed her family goat an  animal that's absolutely sacred in their  culture  that's right drake is technically  divorced moral of the episode don't  arrange a friendship ceremony for your  internet pen pals  season three of drake and josh included  an episode called playing the field and  that's exactly what drake did  not wanting to label his relationship  with tori he gets pushed into a corner  when she refers to him as her boyfriend  boyfriend the cutest in return he breaks  up with her  when tory visits the premier theater  with a guy that next day  drake tries to push aside his jealousy  but josh helps him realize he made a  huge mistake  in order to get her back he uses liza to  make her jealous  tori sees right through him but in a  turn of events his skewed plan of using  liza is actually successful  although it all works out in drake's  favor and the two start dating we never  see tori in future episodes  the relationship in the episode girl  power was a tough break for drake  he's completely smitten with his new  girlfriend lucy until she defends him  after he gets beat up by a football  player before drake can even react to  getting pushed down  she gets involved and literally manages  to throw drake's bully across the room  although he pretends to be grateful for  her stepping in he just can't get past  the fact that he could be dating someone  who is tougher than he is  when josh confronts him about it he  denies that he's uncomfortable but  eventually brings it up to lucy  the couple arrange a fight to settle  their dispute once and for all  but while doing so he ends up crashing  josh's second chance at impressing  mindy's parents 