 another breakup with mindy drake  tries to cheer joshua by holding a  competition  whoever can get a date with the most  girls wins  when drake asks carly as part of the  challenge he doesn't expect to actually  like her  the two start dating until she finds out  she was part of a bat  drake likes her so much that he does  everything he can to prove that he's  trustworthy  but it isn't until he tells all the  girls that we're a part of the bet the  truth that she forgives him and they  begin dating  carly returns as drake's girlfriend in  the episode the storm for a party at  drake and josh's home  little does drake know that lucy his  tough ex-girlfriend  will also be at the party when carly and  lucy hit it off drake worries that lucy  will manage to beat him down again  and embarrass him in front of carly  instead drake actually gets  what to him is the best compliment ever  the girls discuss how amazing of a  kisser he is  although carly appears toward the end of  the series viewers never get any insight  on what happened to their relationship  in the end  drake's excessive dating and josh's  awkwardness may have been a tad dramatic  but it led to some epic comedic moments  not to mention their love life turmoils  really showed how strong drake and  josh's bond was in the end  what was your favorite ship on drake and  josh who do you think drake should have  ended up with in the end  let us know what you think about the  romantic endeavors in the comment  section below  don't forget to hit that subscribe  button and ring that notification bell  for more videos just like this one  until next time
 

